---
title: "Health Sciences Program"
---

The Associate of Science degree in Health Sciences is designed to prepare students for transfer into a four-year program related to Healthcare, Public Health, and/or Kinesiology.

**Program Chair**: Brigitte Casteel • [bcasteel@vhcc.edu](mailto:efairbanks@vhcc.edu) • 276-739-2440

