| ENG 111 | College Composition I | 3 |
| ART/HUM/MUS | ART/HUM/MUS from UCGS1 | 3 |
| MTH 245 or MTH 263 | Statistics I or Calculus I | 3 |
| BIO 101 | General Biology I | 4 |
| | **Total** | 14 |

